# Meager Meal's "up to one target creature" may be none: Bot1 chooses no creature (its Memnite gets no counter) and itself as the
# player, gaining 2 life (22). It costs {B}: with only Mox Pearl in play it is not offered (the pip is pinned), and with Mox Jet it is.

[Bot1 Deck]
Gollum, Silent Slinker
Mox Pearl
Memnite
Mox Jet
Plains x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
! Bot1.Hand.Gollum, Silent Slinker.Cast(Ability: Meager Meal; Mana: short)
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Gollum, Silent Slinker.Cast(Ability: Meager Meal)
Bot1.Target()
Bot1.Target(Bot1)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 22
Bot2.Life = 20
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Power = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = (absent)
Exile = Gollum, Silent Slinker
